  <item>
    <title>11.《死侍与金刚狼》：洛基加冕故事之神后给大家编的第一个歌舞片</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a6112a33ddcbb53c9d1ed2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a6112a33ddcbb53c9d1ed2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Jul 2024 09:36:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Z</span></p><span></span><p><span>树下蹊</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于本期】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目因为录制于深夜便利店，音效和内容上有瑕疵还望见谅！（死侍果然是歌舞片，QQ音乐上想听它的原声还要单独购买专辑才能播放……合理怀疑这电影就是用来卖歌的！）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="276">04:36</a> 嘉宾打分，并简单介绍和推荐本片，不含剧透</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="277">04:37</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="577">09:37</a> 从此部分开始剧透。优点环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="577">09:37</a>-结尾 缺点和吐槽（穿插部分Z的优点补充）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shoop - Salt-N-Pepa</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bye Bye Bye - *NSYNC</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmreeIeZDP-PIso793Wb1lBrMgVC.m4a" length="63916421" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:02</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoyYKrLb2iFHK728TxuQlfZH39Tg.png"/>
